[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3 uid="uid://bqv2w5ynl3rk8"]

; The belt line of the v2 ventilation room (T-V2-06). The three sprites show the parts of the
; painted conveyor the game moves, cut out of level0_section2_ventilation_r2_floor.svg by
; tools/derive_section2_r2.py; their positions here are the room's own placement (backdrop at
; level x 1280, SectionX 0, OffsetY -227.06, WorldScale 1280/680, ImportScale 3), relative to this
; node's origin at the middle of the drawn conveyor on the walk band. tests/smoke/props_conveyor.gd
; recomputes every one of them from the mockup coordinates.
; The root is an Area2D, not a wall: the hero can step onto the belt, and while it runs it carries
; him back out (CarrySpeed against his own MoveSpeed). Mask 2 is the Player layer. RailFar and
; RailNear close the walk band above and below the drawn belt, so the belt is the only way past.
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/props/ConveyorLine.cs" id="1_line"]
